  "summary": "Hubble ultraviolet spectra of ZTF J0328-1219 fit accretion of a chondritic body, and 16 days of 2025 photometry show the dominant transit period changing from 9.937 to 11.17 hours and back. The changes suggest collisions in the debris. It is one system over a short campaign, and a possible 7.64 hour period is uncertain.",
